    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mechanical art for Edward Gorey's first Doubleday Anchor cover, created in 1953. Jason Epstein, Doubleday Anchor's co-founder, and his then-wife Barbara commissioned Gorey for the imprint's early cover designs."
    },
